{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-instruction-files#card-zh","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-instruction-files","commit":"bd606d873319cdd35d2b3b7e9e1dd57e9bb7ea42","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 指令文件与角色是面向 DSH Web 客户端的工作区提示词和 Agent 预设插件。它在系统提示词中注册工作区指令区块，并通过设置页管理配置。用户可按需加载 IDENTITY.md、SOUL.md、AGENTS.md、TOOLS.md、USER.md 和 MEMORY.md，也可让身份文件替换身份区块；更改会在后续模型步骤重新读取。角色预设还能绑定工作区、新会话默认模型和权限，适合希望按项目组织指令或为不同工作区设置角色的人使用。需要兼容的 DSH 主机及工作区文件系统服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["workspace-prompt.js:53-64","workspace-prompt.js:125-164"]}
{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-instruction-files#card-en","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-instruction-files","commit":"bd606d873319cdd35d2b3b7e9e1dd57e9bb7ea42","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Instruction Files & Agent Profiles loads selected workspace Markdown into prompt sections and optionally uses IDENTITY.md as the identity section. Profiles set a workspace, model, and permissions for new sessions. It requires a compatible DSH host.","source":"generated","evidence":["workspace-prompt.js:53-64","workspace-prompt.js:125-164"]}
