{"unit_id":"Kerberos255__dsh-instruction-files#feature-1","repo":"Kerberos255/dsh-instruction-files","commit":"bd606d873319cdd35d2b3b7e9e1dd57e9bb7ea42","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 指令文件与角色的功能「workspace-files」：按工作区载入 Markdown 指令：启用后读取身份、风格、Agent 规则、工具说明、用户偏好和记忆文件，并按开关放入各自提示词区块。","source":"generated","evidence":["workspace-prompt.js:85-95"]}
